            "type": "game",
            "name": "Squishies",
            "steam_appid": 593060,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593060/extras/e2e280ef5874492fc03aa1f066143374.avif?t=1666005656\" width=600 height=188 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get lost in the Squishy-verse!</h2><br>Squishies is a head-scratching, puzzle focused VR platformer where you guide courageous and cute creatures through a series of increasingly hazardous, challenging mazes. Use unique motion controls, custom designed for VR, to push and pull the Squishies through their adventures in a colorful universe full of strange flora and fauna. Keep those little rascals safe while they climb, jump, fly and teleport-by-fish through 100 levels in five alien worlds.!<br><br>You push and pull the Squishies from one side of the maze to the other, all while earning medals, gathering crystals, climbing slopes, and avoiding pitfalls.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a huge universe, across 100 levels in five different worlds.<br></li><li>A game <strong>truly made</strong> for VR - the controls and design were specifically designed for this dimension.<br></li><li>Challenge yourself - gather all the crystals, beat the clock or find the hidden egg in each level.<br></li><li><strong>Level Editor</strong> - Squishies really comes into its own with its innovative, fully featured creation tools. The same tools we used to build the game!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593060/extras/a7bbc7eeb3ec2283fb2292d0460831ed.avif?t=1666005656\" width=600 height=120 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Squishies are in need of a hero!</h2><br>A long time ago, aliens invaded the Squishy-verse after discovering that it harbours a huge number of crystals which can be used as energy sources. Now long gone, they have left the Squishies stranded all over the five worlds of their universe. <br><br>Fortunately the aliens also left behind one of their crystal collectors. This is where you come in - take control, operate the alien fish and save your friends by finally rolling them home!<br><br><strong>Valve Index Support</strong><br>Although the game is playable with Valve Index, we ask for your understanding that we have not yet mapped the control scheme. Therefore some buttons might do different things than you expect them to - but just try them out and you'll get it!<br><br><strong>Servers inactivei</strong><br>Unfortunately our service provider for sharing levels has ceased operations, sharing levels with the community is currently not possible. Due to limited resource we were unable to migrate to a new service, we'll keep you posted on our progress.",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593060/extras/e2e280ef5874492fc03aa1f066143374.avif?t=1666005656\" width=600 height=188 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get lost in the Squishy-verse!</h2><br>Squishies is a head-scratching, puzzle focused VR platformer where you guide courageous and cute creatures through a series of increasingly hazardous, challenging mazes. Use unique motion controls, custom designed for VR, to push and pull the Squishies through their adventures in a colorful universe full of strange flora and fauna. Keep those little rascals safe while they climb, jump, fly and teleport-by-fish through 100 levels in five alien worlds.!<br><br>You push and pull the Squishies from one side of the maze to the other, all while earning medals, gathering crystals, climbing slopes, and avoiding pitfalls.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Explore a huge universe, across 100 levels in five different worlds.<br></li><li>A game <strong>truly made</strong> for VR - the controls and design were specifically designed for this dimension.<br></li><li>Challenge yourself - gather all the crystals, beat the clock or find the hidden egg in each level.<br></li><li><strong>Level Editor</strong> - Squishies really comes into its own with its innovative, fully featured creation tools. The same tools we used to build the game!</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/593060/extras/a7bbc7eeb3ec2283fb2292d0460831ed.avif?t=1666005656\" width=600 height=120 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Squishies are in need of a hero!</h2><br>A long time ago, aliens invaded the Squishy-verse after discovering that it harbours a huge number of crystals which can be used as energy sources. Now long gone, they have left the Squishies stranded all over the five worlds of their universe. <br><br>Fortunately the aliens also left behind one of their crystal collectors. This is where you come in - take control, operate the alien fish and save your friends by finally rolling them home!<br><br><strong>Valve Index Support</strong><br>Although the game is playable with Valve Index, we ask for your understanding that we have not yet mapped the control scheme. Therefore some buttons might do different things than you expect them to - but just try them out and you'll get it!<br><br><strong>Servers inactivei</strong><br>Unfortunately our service provider for sharing levels has ceased operations, sharing levels with the community is currently not possible. Due to limited resource we were unable to migrate to a new service, we'll keep you posted on our progress.",
            "short_description": "Help the stranded Squishies find their way back home! Push and pull them through perilous mazes, or create your own levels with the powerful in-game editor - everything was made entirely for VR!",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês, Francês, Italiano, Alemão, Espanhol (Espanha), Japonês, Português (Brasil), Russo, Chinês simplificado, Chinês tradicional",
            "reviews": {
                "query_summary": {
                    "num_reviews": 1,
                    "review_score": 0,
                    "review_score_desc": "7 user reviews",
                    "total_positive": 6,
                    "total_negative": 1,
                    "total_reviews": 7
                },
                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "116894171",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197970843607",
                            "num_reviews": 148,
                            "playtime_forever": 12,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 12,
                            "last_played": 1655072887
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "To be perfectly honest I was a little bored of this game by the third of fourth level, this is however no fault of the game itself, I'm just not the target audience for it. Regardless, it deserves a little bit more hype and awareness than what it seemingly has at the moment; this is a proper VR game, as opposed to a game that you happen to just play in VR, and there's not enough of these.\n\nThis is much more of a kids game than anything, while it didnt hold my interest for very long it is one of the most refined and well made VR games available. For children under 15 this would be a must play as that age range would enjoy this the most I think.\n\nThe way you scale, rotate and move the environment in particular was really well implemented, I think I spent more time messing around with the map than actually playing the game. \n\nThe gameplay itself revolves around using the controllers to blow or suck air the titular squshies to navigate them through the environment. Its cute, charming, very well made and even though it wasnt for me personally I recommend it to anyone with children around.\n\nAlthough not specifically listed as supported, I had zero issues playing this with the Quest 2.",
